error[B0217]: `on_keydown` is not an event the client listens for
  --> t.beck:114:30
    |
114 |                         span(on_keydown=Toggle(id=t.id)): t.text
    |                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this would be an attribute wired to nothing
    |
  = note: the client interprets `on_click` (a click on this element), `on_enter` (the Enter key, in a text input), `on_submit` (a form submission), `on_input` (each edit to a control's value), `on_change` (a committed change to a control's value)
  = help: did you mean `on_enter`?
